OL,3,GNEWSATwo boys seriously injured in
OL,4,Ae-scooter fall
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo boys have been seriously hurt, with
OL,7,Fone suffering life-threatening
OL,8,Finjuries, after falling from an
OL,9,Fe-scooter, police said.
OL,11,FNorfolk Police said two boys were on
OL,12,FFrensham Road in Norwich when they fell
OL,13,Ffrom the scooter at about 11:29 BST on
OL,14,FMonday.
OL,16,FOne boy was taken to Addenbrooke's
OL,17,FHospital in Cambridge in a
OL,18,Flife-threatening condition and the
OL,19,Fother boy was taken to the Norfolk and
OL,20,FNorwich University Hospital but has
OL,21,Fbeen discharged.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
